# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` may upload. Everything is excluded, then only the server files are let back in.
# This keeps .env, tokens, node_modules, the site and your git history off Google Cloud.
*
!Dockerfile
!server/
!server/community-api.ts
!server/known-merchants.json
!server/runtime-package.json
!src/
!src/community/
!src/community/*.ts
src/community/*.test.ts
